	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salus et pax Christi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Secunda maii redditae sunt michi literę<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Brief, der offenbar Nachrichten über den <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Anstand enthielt, ist nicht nicht mehr vorhanden. Ein paralleles Schreiben muß auch <persName ref="p1419">Johannes Haab</persName> erhalten haben; vgl. unten <ref target="file11308">Nr. 1265</ref>, 4f und 12-14.</note> tuae, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, fratrum charissime, quae michi tuam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>sollicitudinem satis<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">satis <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> testantur.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Et recte quidem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>de sęculorum fine ratiocinaris ob miras illas <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>et stupendas mundi machinationes; quid enim <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>non tentat mundus, quid non molitur satan <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>ad demoliendam veritatem Christi?</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quanquam <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>hoc ipsum leve esset, nisi inclinaret defectio <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>illa praedicta per Christum<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 24, 10</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>1Tim 4, 1</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Eorum vero defectio <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>est, de quibus spes erat consistendi contra <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>mundum, satanam et varias adversitates; nunc <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>illi vincuntur (quod valde metuo) non gladiis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>et persecutione, sed umbra tantum, non terrore, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sed blandiloquentia.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Bone optimeque deus, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quantum pecuniae absumptum est, quantum <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>temporis perditum a nostris consultoribus et <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>consiliariis,<pb type="edition" next="124"/> quanquam et istud lenius esset, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>si non interim turpissime proderemus nos ipsos <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>et prostitueremus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Pro immortalem Christum, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quam non simus animati quamque non cohęreamus fort<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>iter, sic denudat nos diabolus meridian<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>a luce splendidior.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Nos toti sumus consternati <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ad istos futiles conatus et ad istas <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>lubricas disputationes in re tam certa et <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>clara.<pb type="scan" next="108v."/></s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Quorsum enim adtinet convenire nos ministros <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>novę concordię causa<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p4079">Zwick</persName> bezieht sich auf die in <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurt</placeName> beschlossene Einberufung einer Tagung, an der über die Beilegung der religiösen Differenzen verhandelt werden sollte (vgl. oben <ref target="file11304">Nr. 1261</ref>, Anm. 6).</note>?</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">An quia non convenimus <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>in Christo, an quia contra Christum inituri concordiam?</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>An vero, ut ex subtili et sophistico <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>concordiae studio atrocissima discordia <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>paretur, ex qua deinde longe atrocior <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>persecutio nascatur?</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed hic praestabit <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>contemptis omnibus sapientum astutiis simpli<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>citati et veritati constanter adhęrere nec <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>moveri ad ampullas et sesquipedalia <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>argumenta<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. Horaz, Ars poetica 97.</note> quorumvis.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z12"/>O mi frater, quantum <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>putas nobis nocitura consilia ista Gallica<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Gemeint sind die von <persName ref="p4079">Zwick</persName> bereits früher kritisierten "consilia ad Gallos", die <persName ref="p2095">Melanchthon</persName>, <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> und <persName ref="p8374">Hedio</persName> 1534 als Vorarbeit für ein Religionsgespräch verfaßt hatten; vgl. <bibl source="b7">HBBW V</bibl> <ref target="file10549">[Nr. 513]</ref>, S. 62, Anm. 4.</note>!</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>Quid sibi voluit ferventissimum concordandi <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>studium?</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Scilicet ut confundamur tandem <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>confusione confusissima, a qua tamen <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>liberare nos dignetur Christus noster.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z18"/>Hęc in sinum tuum, donec videamus exitum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/><persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius Blarer</persName>.</note> vero ad te scribit, quo in statu <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>res sit<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Siehe oben <ref target="file11304">Nr. 1261</ref>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Ego de nostrorum constantia non <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>dubito, quanquam misera sit nostra conditio, <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>qui non multae autoritatis sumus apud<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>vor</hi> apud <hi>gestrichenes</hi> q.</note> <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>magnates huius mundi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z24"/>De novitatibus Anglicis<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11281">Nr. 1238</ref>.</note> habemus tibi gratiam; <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>nam in illis multa sunt, quae oblectant.<pb type="scan" next="109r."/></s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>Dominus exaudiat clamores bonorum pro sanctifi<lb xml:id="p3z2"/>catione nominis ipsius.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Vae nostrae pusilla<lb xml:id="p3z3"/>nimitati!</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">An hoc est nostris exemplis amplia<lb xml:id="p3z4"/>re regnum Christi et promovere causam evang<lb xml:id="p3z5"/>elii apud exteras nationes?</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Sic nos erigimus <lb xml:id="p3z6"/>labantia genua?</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">An non patet exemplum <lb xml:id="p3z7"/>nocentissimi colloquii primae matris Evę <lb xml:id="p3z8"/>cum satana<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><cit type="bible"><ref>Gen 3, 1-5</ref></cit>.</note>?</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de">Also werdend uns unsere <lb xml:id="p3z9"/>colloquia och usschlachen<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">[zum Nachteil] ausgehen.</note> <foreign xml:lang="la">cum hominibus, <lb xml:id="p3z10"/>de quibus nulla alia<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">alia <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> spes esse potest, quam quae est <lb xml:id="p3z11"/>de satana.</foreign></s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de">Und so man durch die gantzen <lb xml:id="p3z12"/>welt sagen solt, wie wir so dapfer, hantlic<lb xml:id="p3z13"/>h lut<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">etwa im Sinne von: entschlossene Leute.</note> werind und das wir anderen <lb xml:id="p3z14"/>gutherzigen die hand bütind, so gebend <lb xml:id="p3z15"/>wir sy und uns an flaisch banck.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Deus <lb xml:id="p3z16"/>misereatur nostri et sua potentia liberet nos <lb xml:id="p3z17"/>a septenario diabolo, qui tentat posteriora <lb xml:id="p3z18"/>nostra deteriora facere prioribus<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 12, 45</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Lk 11, 26</ref></cit>.</note>.<pb type="edition" next="125"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Sed vale, <lb xml:id="p3z19"/>et tu quoque sedulus esto in oratione ad <lb xml:id="p3z20"/>dominum, ut animet nos gladio verbi sui<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Eph 6, 17</ref></cit>.</note> co<lb xml:id="p3z21"/>nstantissime.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Fratres omnes, <persName ref="p1753">Leonem</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p3z22"/><persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> etc. salvos dicas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z23"/>Ex <placeName ref="l257">Constantia</placeName>, 2. maii 1539.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z24"/>Tuus <persName ref="p4079">Io. Zvick</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p3z25"/>Frater <persName ref="p4082">Cuͦnradus</persName><note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><persName ref="p4082">Konrad Zwick</persName>.</note> salutat te <lb xml:id="p3z26"/>studiose.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Ornatissimo viro <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Hainricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>amantissimo <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>meo in domino fratri<lb xml:id="p4z5"/>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
